[en.DECISION_C01_C14_WAR]
Suppress Appleloosa

[en.DECISION_C01_C14_WAR_desc]
Appleloosa has slipped from our control, it is necessary to punish them as an example, so that other citizens know the Empire’s determination to maintain the dignity of the Empress!
“It seems that we will also offend the rock farm.”
“Uh... well... that could be... Emm... whatever, march!”

[zh.DECISION_C01_C14_WAR]
镇压苹果鲁萨

[zh.DECISION_C01_C14_WAR_desc]
苹果鲁萨已经脱离了我们的掌控，有必要杀鸡儆猴，让其他地方的居民知道帝国维护女皇尊严的决心！
“似乎我们也会得罪采石农场。”
“额...那...这有点...额...哎呀不管了，冲就完了！”
